  "description": "Enigma.Avalonia.Mobile gives Avalonia 12 mobile applications, Android first and iOS alike, the look of Enigma.Avalonia.Desktop: the same 31-colour palette in Dark and Light variants, the same 28 brushes that follow the active variant at runtime, and the same re-colouring of the framework TextBox and ComboBox, all merged from one resource dictionary. It ships no controls and no services, and it is compiled from the very files the desktop library uses, so both packages resolve identical keys and values at the same version.",
