  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "The first release of Enigma.Avalonia.Mobile, versioned in lockstep with Enigma.Avalonia.Desktop 1.3.0. It gives Avalonia 12 mobile applications the Enigma palette, 31 colours in Dark and Light variants, 28 brushes that follow the active variant and the re-colouring of the framework TextBox and ComboBox, from one resource dictionary at avares://Enigma.Avalonia.Mobile/Themes/Fluent.axaml, compiled from the same files as the desktop library. It ships no controls and no services, targets net10.0, and depends on Avalonia and Avalonia.Themes.Fluent 12.1.4 only. See RELEASENOTES.md for the full details.",
